## 🔐 4. Auth-Flow (Clerk)

**`.env.local`:**
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_...
CLERK_SECRET_KEY=sk_...
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_IN_URL=/sign-in
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_UP_URL=/sign-up
```

**`middleware.ts`:**
```ts
import { clerkMiddleware, createRouteMatcher } from '@clerk/nextjs/server'

const isProtected = createRouteMatcher(['/profile(.*)', '/community/create(.*)'])

export default clerkMiddleware(async (auth, req) => {
  if (isProtected(req)) await auth.protect()
})

export const config = {
  matcher: ['/((?!.*\\..*|_next).*)', '/', '/(api|trpc)(.*)'],
}
```

**Layout-Wrap** (`app/layout.tsx`):
```tsx
import { ClerkProvider, SignedIn, SignedOut, SignInButton, UserButton } from '@clerk/nextjs'

// Im <body>:
<ClerkProvider>
  <nav>{/* … */}
    <SignedOut><SignInButton mode="modal"><button className="…">Anmelden</button></SignInButton></SignedOut>
    <SignedIn><UserButton /></SignedIn>
  </nav>
  {children}
</ClerkProvider>
```

**Profil-Sync** (Clerk → Sanity, einmalig):
```ts
// app/actions/sync-profile.ts
'use server'
import { auth, currentUser } from '@clerk/nextjs/server'
import { client } from '@/lib/sanity'

export async function syncProfile() {
  const { userId } = await auth()
  const user = await currentUser()
  if (!userId) return null

  await client.createIfNotExists({
    _id: `traveler-${userId}`,
    _type: 'traveler',
    clerkId: userId,
    name: user?.fullName ?? 'Traveler',
    handle: user?.username ?? 'traveler',
  })
  return { ok: true }
}
```
> Schema-Patch: `defineField({ name: 'clerkId', type: 'string' })` im `traveler`-Schema ergänzen.

**Profil-Seite mit Stempel-Sammlung** (`app/profile/page.tsx`):
```tsx
import { auth } from '@clerk/nextjs/server'
import { client } from '@/lib/sanity'
import { groq } from 'next-sanity'
import { syncProfile } from '../actions/sync-profile'

export default async function ProfilePage() {
  const { userId } = await auth()
  await syncProfile()

  const traveler = await client.fetch(groq`
    *[_type == "traveler" && clerkId == $id][0] {
      name, stamps[]-> { name, country },
      posts: *[_type == "communityPost" && references(^._id)] | order(postedAt desc)
    }`, { id: userId })

  return (
    <main className="min-h-screen bg-[#FAF7F2] py-24 px-6">
      <h1 className="font-serif font-light text-6xl text-[#1A3A52]">{traveler?.name}</h1>
      <p className="font-mono text-sm text-[#D97757] mt-2">{traveler?.stamps?.length ?? 0} Stempel gesammelt</p>
      {/* Stempel-Grid wie Passport-Seite: gestrichelte Kreise, rotiert */}
    </main>
  )
}
```

